        "markdown": "The HTTP handlers in `src/api/routes.ts` are the only entry point for requests. They validate the request body, attach a correlation ID and pass the work on; they contain no business rules. A `POST /reservations` request goes to the reservation orchestrator in `src/orders/reserve.ts`."
      }
