      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "markdown": "The pricing rules in `src/pricing/rules.ts` work out the price of an order from the supplier price lists and any active discounts. They read price lists from Redis, where they are cached for 300 seconds, and they never change stock."
